cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this simulator, or data generated with it, in academic work,
  please cite it as below.
title: "CCE Thermal Simulator (ems-data-simulator)"
abstract: >-
  A physics-based synthetic data generator for cold chain equipment (CCE)
  monitoring systems. It integrates a thermal model of a vaccine refrigerator or
  freezer to produce realistic temperature, power and event time series with
  known, labelled fault conditions, and emits them as payloads conforming to the
  CCE Data Delivery specification for both EMS (Equipment Monitoring System) and
  RTMD (Remote Temperature Monitoring Device) transfer types. Reference
  implementation in Python, with a behaviourally equivalent JavaScript port.
type: software
authors:
